<title>UK: Merrill has Iberian Telecom Basket warrants.</title>
<headline>Merrill has Iberian Telecom Basket warrants.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International said it has issued 500,000 European-style call warrants on a basket of Iberian Telecom shares.</p>
<p>Each basket consists of equal-weighting of shares of Telefonica de Espana and Portugal Telecom. One warrant controls one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    90 CHF		    PREMIUM	6.35 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     16.35 CHF		 GEARING	6.11 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   16.NOV.98		 PAYDATE	06.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LONDON		    MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  100 CHF</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
